{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":26.020000457763672,"text":"A real French submarine, over 50 meters long, which served for decades, and now sits on concrete in the park. You go inside, and the first thing you understand is how narrow it is. The corridors do not take two people side by side, and the beds are stacked in among the pipes. 50 people lived in here for weeks at a time, without seeing daylight, breathing air made by machines.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.6399999856948853},{"word":"real","start":0.6399999856948853,"end":1.1399999856948853},{"word":"French","start":1.1399999856948853,"end":1.559999942779541},{"word":"submarine","start":1.559999942779541,"end":2.119999885559082},{"word":"over","start":2.619999885559082,"end":2.8399999141693115},{"word":"50","start":2.8399999141693115,"end":3.200000047683716},{"word":"meters","start":3.200000047683716,"end":3.4600000381469727},{"word":"long","start":3.4600000381469727,"end":3.9000000953674316},{"word":"which","start":4.320000171661377,"end":4.619999885559082},{"word":"served","start":4.619999885559082,"end":4.800000190734863},{"word":"for","start":4.800000190734863,"end":5.300000190734863},{"word":"decades","start":5.300000190734863,"end":5.679999828338623},{"word":"and","start":5.960000038146973,"end":6.119999885559082},{"word":"now","start":6.119999885559082,"end":6.5},{"word":"sits","start":6.5,"end":6.659999847412109},{"word":"on","start":6.659999847412109,"end":6.960000038146973},{"word":"concrete","start":6.960000038146973,"end":7.260000228881836},{"word":"in","start":7.260000228881836,"end":7.480000019073486},{"word":"the","start":7.480000019073486,"end":7.78000020980835},{"word":"park","start":7.78000020980835,"end":7.800000190734863},{"word":"You","start":8.5,"end":8.699999809265137},{"word":"go","start":8.699999809265137,"end":8.920000076293945},{"word":"inside","start":8.920000076293945,"end":9.359999656677246},{"word":"and","start":9.619999885559082,"end":9.89999961853